            "text": "<div id=\"transaction\">\n  <div role=\"main\" class=\"oj-flex oj-sm-12 oj-md-12 oj-lg-12 oj-xl-12 oj-panel\" style=\"height:auto;overflow:auto\" data-bind=\"attr: {id: screenMnemonic + 'mainContent'}\">\n    <!--ko if:transactionTemplateVisibility()--> \n    <div id=\"transactionScreen\" class=\"oj-flex-item oj-sm-12 oj-md-12 oj-lg-12 oj-xl-12\" data-bind=\"visible: transactionScreenVisibility,attr: {id: screenMnemonic + 'main'}, component: {name: screenMnemonic, params:{rootModel:$data}}\">  \n    </div>\n    <div data-bind=\"attr: {id: 'myModal' + screenMnemonic}\" class=\"modal\">\n        <span class=\"close\" onclick=\"closeImageModal(this);\">&times;</span>\n        <img class=\"modal-content\" data-bind=\"attr: {id: 'img01' + screenMnemonic}\">\n    </div>\n    <!--/ko-->\n    <!--ko if:ChildTxnVisibility()-->\n    <div id=\"childScreen\" class=\"oj-flex-item oj-sm-12 oj-md-12 oj-lg-12 oj-xl-12\" data-bind=\"attr: {id: childMnemonic + 'main'}, component: {name: childMnemonic, params:{rootModel:$data}}\">  \n    </div>        \n    <!--/ko-->\n    <!-- ko if: accessKeyAvailable() -->\n    <div id=\"accessKeyDiv\" class=\"oj-flex-item oj-sm-12 oj-md-12 oj-lg-12 oj-xl-12\" data-bind=\"component : {name: 'fc-access-key', params:{rootModel:$parent, accessKeyChildScreen: accessKeyChildScreen, parentData :parentAccessKeySelf}}, attr: { id: screenMnemonic + 'main' }\">\n    </div>\n    <!--/ko-->\n  </div>\n</div>\n    "
